OL,3,AFrench weekend protests to be limited
OL,4,Ato union demos only, says Macron
OL,5,
OL,6,FOnly authorised union protests will be
OL,7,Fallowed in French towns and cities on
OL,8,FSaturday, President Emmanuel Macron has
OL,9,Fsaid, after demonstrations across the
OL,10,Fcountry turned violent last weekend.
OL,12,FSpeaking as some cities including Lyon
OL,13,Fand Nice imposed complete bans, Macron
OL,14,Fsaid "illegitimate" protests would not
OL,15,Fbe allowed but unions would be offered
OL,16,Falternative routes so that businesses
OL,17,Fcould be protected.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
