OL,3,AFrench weekend protests to be limited
OL,4,Ato union demos only, says Macron
OL,5,
OL,6,FBig demonstrations against the high
OL,7,Fcost of living and school conditions
OL,8,Fwere overshadowed last Saturday by
OL,9,Friots and looting that saw business and
OL,10,Fhistoric buildings destroyed.
OL,12,FInterior Minister Jean-Didier Berger
OL,13,Fsaid police deployments would be
OL,14,Fincreased by 20% compared to last
OL,15,Fweekend, after the government was
OL,16,Faccused of being blindsided by the
OL,17,Fscale of the unrest.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
